Summary of modifications:
- healthbench_eval.py: Added the KampoBench subset; record stop_reason so truncated
  responses can be counted; made get_usage_dict tolerant of the three providers'
  differing `usage` shapes.
- sampler/claude_sampler.py: Allow omitting `temperature` (newer Claude models reject it).
- sampler/gemini_sampler.py: Default temperature 0.0; report finish_reason.
- sampler/responses_sampler.py: Report `status` / `incomplete_details`.
- simple_evals.py: Model registry updated to current models; `--grader` to choose the
  grading model; `--no-cache`; results routed by cost tier and grader.
- grade_saved.py (new): Re-grade saved responses with a different grader, without
  regenerating the responses.
- response_cache.py (new): Cache API responses on disk so a run interrupted by a quota
  limit can resume without repeating paid calls.
- result_paths.py (new), aggregate_results.py (new): Output routing and result aggregation.

